@api = http://localhost:3002

GET {{api}}/chat/status?league=DGFBL

### Refresh the complete league player pool (requires the configured ESPN session)
POST {{api}}/chat/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "league": "DGFBL" }

### Refresh public category z-scores (no ESPN login or OpenAI call)
POST {{api}}/chat/rankings/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "league": "DGFBL" }

### Refresh current-season Yahoo ADP (no ESPN login or OpenAI call)
POST {{api}}/chat/adp/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "league": "DGFBL" }

### Ask using ESPN ownership/projections, public BBM rankings and current-season Yahoo ADP
POST {{api}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "league": "DGFBL",
  "teamId": "1",
  "message": "I am punting assists. Use Basketball Monster z-scores and our ESPN projections to suggest pickups that strengthen my competitive categories. Include current-season Yahoo ADP as a market-value signal. Explain the drop and each data source's season.",
  "research": false,
  "history": []
}
